  "description": "<p>Rothco's Tactical Duty Pants offer the perfect blend of functionality and comfort. Crafted from durable poly/cotton rip-stop material with a stain-resistant finish, these pants are ideal for first responders and EMTs. The expandable waistband and extra-wide belt loops enhance comfort and mobility. Featuring eight multi-functional utility pockets, including knee pad insert slits for additional protection. Reinforced knees and seat ensure maximum durability, making them suitable for both work and outdoor use.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
